  "content": "# 第23题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★☆☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\n23. What should applicants do before filling out the application form？\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. Contact UNESCO managers．\n\nB. B. Get access to the database．\n\nC. C. Keep a motivation letter at hand．\n\nD. D. Work in a team for six months．\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nC\n\n",
  "answer": "A",
  "analysis": "本题考查情态动词。mustn't禁止；needn't不必；can't不能；shouldn't不应该。根据‘已经完成了’可知不必再担心，故选A。"
